    kg:scepterDescription "Lowers cooldown by %bonus_AbilityCooldown%s and increases duration. If an enemy is killed in the Arena, Mars and all of his allies inside the Arena restore %arena_kill_buff_heal_pct%% of their max health and mana and get a %arena_kill_buff_damage_pct%% attack damage buff for %arena_kill_buff_duration%s. This effect stacks."^^xsd:string ;
