    kg:damageType "Magical"^^xsd:string ;
    kg:damageTypeCode 2 ;
    kg:description "Largo strums a tune to a friendly hero. The hero's items and abilities have reduced mana cost and a percentage of their damage reverberates over the following %damage_duration% seconds. When an affected hero spends mana, the remaining buff duration is reduced by %duration_reduction%s. Duration is not reduced for Largo himself."^^xsd:string ;
