    kg:behaviorFlags 0 ;
    kg:damageTypeCode 0 ;
    kg:description "Phantom Assassin refines her combat abilities, acquiring a chance of gaining Deadly Focus with each attack. When attacking with Deadly Focus, Phantom Assassin will consume the buff and guarantee a critical hit. Stifling Dagger has a bonus chance to cause Deadly Focus."^^xsd:string ;
