    kg:behaviorFlags 0 ;
    kg:damageType "Magical"^^xsd:string ;
    kg:damageTypeCode 2 ;
    kg:description "Dragon Knight assumes the form of the Elder Dragon, increasing the range of his abilities, gaining bonus movement speed, and a ranged attack with various properties. The Dragon evolves per level. The bonuses are cumulative. Level 1 Green : Grants a corrosive damage over time that can also damage buildings. Level 2 Red : Grants splash damage to the dragon's attacks. Level 3 Blue : Grants a debuff immunity piercing movement and attack frost slow on attack."^^xsd:string ;
