    kg:damageType "Magical"^^xsd:string ;
    kg:damageTypeCode 2 ;
    kg:description "Summons dark energies around an ally unit, dispelling them and creating an all damage barrier that absorbs a set amount of damage before expiring. When the barrier is destroyed it will burst and deal damage equal to the amount it could absorb to an area around it. DISPEL TYPE: Strong Dispel"^^xsd:string ;
