    kg:maxLevel 3 ;
    kg:scepterDescription "Spawns a monkey soldier near Monkey King at regular intervals. Soldiers do not spawn while invisible or on trees. Soldiers only attack buildings when Monkey King himself is nearby. Soldiers can now gain Jingu Mastery charges independently."^^xsd:string ;
