    kg:gameplayDescription "Eager to dash into danger at a moment's notice, the Pangolier thrives on disrupting enemy movements and placing himself in the midst of chaos. Artfully guiding his blade between cracks in armor and shrugging off attacks with his protective scales , this graceful swordsman is always ready to roll into battle."^^xsd:string ;
